      "content": "but \"making it right\" feels like a joke. how do you make it right when you can't undo what happened? it's not like a mistake you can just apologize for. it's like i've fundamentally changed what kind of person i am. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's just... emptiness and this constant, sick feeling that i'm a danger to everyone around me just by existing.",
